1
00:01:47,300 --> 00:01:51,940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

2
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:54,980
[Episode 28]
[This story is purely fictional]

3
00:01:56,300 --> 00:02:01,420
[Huo's Secondary Residence, Changsha Suburb]

4
00:02:13,430 --> 00:02:14,500
Fifth Master,

5
00:02:14,910 --> 00:02:16,380
stop walking back and forth.

6
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:18,570
It annoys me.

7
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:21,690
Still no news from the city?

8
00:02:22,590 --> 00:02:23,570
Relax.

9
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:24,610
Master Zhang

10
00:02:24,870 --> 00:02:26,290
has a plan.

11
00:02:28,310 --> 00:02:28,890
Anyway,

12
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:30,010
it's almost done.

13
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:31,180
We can eat soon.

14
00:02:31,180 --> 00:02:31,890
I don't have the appetite.

15
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:32,980
You can eat.

16
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:35,980
Where are you going?

17
00:02:40,590 --> 00:02:41,450
Dear Godfather,

18
00:02:42,190 --> 00:02:43,010
the south is in turmoil.

19
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:45,690
Our southern transportation route was suddenly sealed by the officials.

20
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:48,500
My companions from the Mystic Nine have been accused of thievery.

21
00:02:49,030 --> 00:02:49,780
Our movement is very much limited,

22
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:50,730
and we are in great danger.

23
00:02:52,030 --> 00:02:53,540
I seek your assistance to release a statement

24
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:55,220
clarifying the legal status

25
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:56,450
of our goods

26
00:02:57,190 --> 00:02:58,130
so that the seal can be lifted.

27
00:02:58,840 --> 00:02:59,690
Your help is much appreciated.

28
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:02,690
Miss Huo.

29
00:03:03,630 --> 00:03:05,220
Send this telegram to Beiping.

30
00:03:05,310 --> 00:03:06,540
Don't let anyone find out.

31
00:03:15,630 --> 00:03:16,850
Should I congratulate you

32
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:18,410
on your promotion?

33
00:03:19,080 --> 00:03:20,290
There's nothing to celebrate.

34
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:23,690
This position

35
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:25,290
means more duties and restraints.

36
00:03:27,630 --> 00:03:28,170
Thank you.

37
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:31,100
Have you

38
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:33,820
paid attention to the goings-on lately?

39
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:36,850
The situation is tense.

40
00:03:38,190 --> 00:03:40,010
We will go to war with Japan soon.

41
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:41,570
Therefore,

42
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:44,410
what Huo Wenhai did was perfectly

43
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:46,010
understandable.

44
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:48,660
Before we fight a common enemy, we must ensure there's no in-fighting.

45
00:03:51,630 --> 00:03:53,570
The Mystic Nine is a threat.

46
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:01,890
This cannot have come from you.

47
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:03,940
It's unlike you.

48
00:04:04,520 --> 00:04:05,290
Of course it wasn't me.

49
00:04:06,590 --> 00:04:07,170
But

50
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:10,410
you are supposed to get rid of the Mystic Nine,

51
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:11,940
yet you still haven't done that.

52
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:13,690
You put me in a difficult situation.

53
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:16,220
The current situation

54
00:04:17,310 --> 00:04:18,610
solves both our conundrums.

55
00:04:20,310 --> 00:04:21,100
As I said,

56
00:04:22,070 --> 00:04:23,610
this is going to happen to the Mystic Nine one day.

57
00:04:25,310 --> 00:04:27,050
But the Mystic Nine helped to sabotage

58
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:29,340
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama's plan.

59
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:31,700
If the Mystic Nine is eradicated,

60
00:04:32,390 --> 00:04:33,660
other sects in the city

61
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:35,700
will take up arms and attack

62
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:37,580
the Ministry of War.

63
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:39,410
It will jeopardize

64
00:04:41,630 --> 00:04:42,590
future governance.

65
00:04:43,070 --> 00:04:44,220
That's my excuse

66
00:04:44,830 --> 00:04:46,020
to tell Huo Wenhai

67
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:48,290
to just capture all of you, not kill.

68
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:50,530
But the higher-up now knows

69
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:51,540
that the Mystic Nine has been captured.

70
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:53,340
If the execution order comes through,

71
00:04:54,160 --> 00:04:55,460
I won't be able to stop it.

72
00:04:58,120 --> 00:04:58,580
Luo Ang.

73
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:01,220
I know you hold onto your principles

74
00:05:01,270 --> 00:05:02,540
more so than I do.

75
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:04,780
If the Ministry of War makes an order,

76
00:05:04,830 --> 00:05:05,850
you'll see it through.

77
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:08,100
But we are close friends.

78
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:11,780
Can you spare the Mystic Nine?

79
00:05:18,190 --> 00:05:19,610
If you had followed my advice

80
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,140
and dealt with the Mystic Nine accordingly,

81
00:05:23,070 --> 00:05:24,850
I would have let this slide.

82
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,930
But Huo Wenhai now wants

83
00:05:28,390 --> 00:05:29,780
the Mystic Nine gone.

84
00:05:30,310 --> 00:05:31,610
And you can't do anything about it.

85
00:05:33,160 --> 00:05:34,730
If you want to spare the Mystic Nine...

86
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:36,020
Unless

87
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:38,580
Huo Wenhai commits a violation.

88
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:41,100
Then, you become the special commissioner

89
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:42,250
who deals with the Mystic Nine.

90
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:43,410
That way,

91
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:45,490
you'll have the chance to find a loophole.

92
00:05:48,630 --> 00:05:49,540
It's a military order.

93
00:05:50,830 --> 00:05:51,490
Whether Huo Wenhai

94
00:05:52,430 --> 00:05:53,730
or I execute it,

95
00:05:54,190 --> 00:05:55,140
what difference does it make?

96
00:05:55,750 --> 00:05:56,370
Zhang Qishan.

97
00:05:57,390 --> 00:05:58,810
If you get rid of the Mystic Nine,

98
00:05:59,750 --> 00:06:00,980
you'll be doing the Ministry of War a favor.

99
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:03,140
You're siding with it.

100
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:06,540
Naturally, the ministry will think highly of you.

101
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:09,410
After all these years,

102
00:06:10,430 --> 00:06:12,050
the higher-up is no longer sure

103
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:14,700
if you're the Mystic Nine

104
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:16,700
or the defense commander.

105
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,290
To put it bluntly,

106
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:20,930
if the Mystic Nine falls,

107
00:06:21,390 --> 00:06:23,410
you have to die as well.

108
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:25,850
But that's not the outcome I want.

109
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:28,220
You are an excellent soldier.

110
00:06:28,870 --> 00:06:30,340
You should die on the battlefield.

111
00:06:39,430 --> 00:06:40,580
Xie Jiu has confessed.

112
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:43,020
He said he was forced

113
00:06:43,950 --> 00:06:45,220
to work with the Japanese.

114
00:06:45,830 --> 00:06:47,050
The one who coerced him

115
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:51,100
was Changsha Special Commissioner,

116
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:52,220
Huo Wenhai.

117
00:06:55,390 --> 00:06:56,980
When I submit evidence of their collusion

118
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:58,930
to the Ministry of War,

119
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:02,140
you will become

120
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:03,930
the special commissioner.

121
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:06,610
Xie Jiu

122
00:07:07,430 --> 00:07:08,900
has already committed suicide in the cell.

123
00:07:11,240 --> 00:07:11,780
What?

124
00:07:17,630 --> 00:07:19,020
[To Master Zhang, From Xie]
He left this letter to you.

125
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:26,900
Don't let him die in vain.

126
00:07:34,420 --> 00:07:36,500
[To Master Zhang, From Xie]

127
00:07:48,950 --> 00:07:49,490
Master Zhang.

128
00:07:50,310 --> 00:07:51,900
When you're reading this,

129
00:07:52,390 --> 00:07:53,780
I'm probably gone.

130
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:55,780
Do not avenge me.

131
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:58,660
Master Zhang.

132
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:01,730
My fate is sealed.

133
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:03,290
I die willingly.

134
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:04,580
Do not worry about me.

135
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:06,780
Remember.

136
00:08:07,630 --> 00:08:09,780
The time is running out for the Mystic Nine.

137
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:22,250
You have two options.

138
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:23,580
One,

139
00:08:24,190 --> 00:08:25,220
defy the military order

140
00:08:25,510 --> 00:08:26,410
and protect the Mystic Nine.

141
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:28,580
Luo Ang

142
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:31,100
will reinstate Huo Wenhai.

143
00:08:31,750 --> 00:08:33,530
Huo Wenhai will not show mercy,

144
00:08:34,080 --> 00:08:35,370
and the Mystic Nine will fall.

145
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:37,130
What about my second option?

146
00:08:37,630 --> 00:08:39,130
Kill six to protect three.

147
00:08:39,390 --> 00:08:39,980
No way.

148
00:08:40,120 --> 00:08:41,420
Don't jump to conclusions.

149
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:42,650
Listen to me.

150
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:43,250
You know

151
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,490
I will not do this

152
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:47,850
just to protect myself.

153
00:08:48,360 --> 00:08:49,250
Zhang Qishan.

154
00:08:49,670 --> 00:08:50,420
Do you

155
00:08:50,600 --> 00:08:51,640
really want to sit and watch how they

156
00:08:51,640 --> 00:08:52,610
get rid of the Mystic Nine?

157
00:08:58,080 --> 00:08:58,770
The Mystic Nine.

158
00:08:59,200 --> 00:09:00,130
Kill six clans

159
00:09:00,550 --> 00:09:01,460
to protect three clans.

160
00:09:02,750 --> 00:09:03,650
The Ministry of War

161
00:09:03,790 --> 00:09:05,700
and I agreed on this.

162
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:07,610
It's the limit

163
00:09:07,670 --> 00:09:09,180
of their leniency.

164
00:09:14,510 --> 00:09:15,010
Xie Jiu.

165
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:20,220
I know you have a plan.

166
00:09:21,670 --> 00:09:22,580
Help me again.

167
00:09:24,320 --> 00:09:25,100
Master Zhang.

168
00:09:26,750 --> 00:09:27,980
Our killer isn't

169
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:28,890
the Ministry of War.

170
00:09:30,150 --> 00:09:32,010
It's the status quo.

171
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:34,580
You are a smart man.

172
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:36,890
You know the right decision to make.

173
00:09:40,390 --> 00:09:41,610
Do not be carried away by your emotion.

174
00:09:41,870 --> 00:09:43,010
Without the Mystic Nine,

175
00:09:45,510 --> 00:09:47,300
the world wouldn't be as peaceful now!

176
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:53,420
I will not let them down.

177
00:09:58,630 --> 00:09:59,770
If I must sacrifice myself

178
00:09:59,910 --> 00:10:00,730
to keep the Mystic Nine safe...

179
00:10:00,790 --> 00:10:01,580
Master Zhang.

180
00:10:03,790 --> 00:10:04,130
Master Zhang.

181
00:10:04,630 --> 00:10:05,490
I'm running out of time.

182
00:10:07,630 --> 00:10:08,610
You already know

183
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:10,420
which six clans

184
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:11,820
to eliminate.

185
00:10:12,550 --> 00:10:13,180
Right?

186
00:10:31,870 --> 00:10:33,060
Eryue Hong must be spared.

187
00:10:34,790 --> 00:10:35,980
Huo Xiangu must be spared.

188
00:10:37,670 --> 00:10:38,730
One is a renowned opera actor.

189
00:10:39,790 --> 00:10:41,100
The other has a clan full of women.

190
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:43,420
If the Ministry of War

191
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:44,770
kills them,

192
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:47,650
there'll be a public outrage,

193
00:10:48,390 --> 00:10:49,250
or even a riot.

194
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:54,530
You are a Japanese sympathizer.

195
00:10:57,150 --> 00:10:58,370
So you're destined to die.

196
00:11:01,360 --> 00:11:02,610
Chen Pi is a thug.

197
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:05,370
Heibei is a murderer.

198
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:08,010
Li is a gangster.

199
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:10,100
Tiezui...

200
00:11:10,240 --> 00:11:11,420
None of them can live.

201
00:11:12,270 --> 00:11:13,700
But you're different, Master Zhang.

202
00:11:14,510 --> 00:11:15,980
You have to fight our invader.

203
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:16,940
We cannot kill Laogou.

204
00:11:17,240 --> 00:11:18,280
He has saved so many people.

205
00:11:18,280 --> 00:11:19,100
He's also a thug.

206
00:11:19,270 --> 00:11:20,940
Wu Laogou has to die.

207
00:11:29,030 --> 00:11:29,700
Master Zhang.

208
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:33,420
The Mystic Nine is old.

209
00:11:35,270 --> 00:11:36,180
We can't carry on anymore.

210
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:38,730
But you

211
00:11:39,790 --> 00:11:41,850
must forge on with those

212
00:11:42,510 --> 00:11:43,370
who live.

213
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:47,420
Don't look back.

214
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:28,700
To Ninth Master.

215
00:12:56,750 --> 00:12:57,650
Does he

216
00:12:57,670 --> 00:12:58,700
not have a better plan?

217
00:12:59,390 --> 00:13:00,580
He sacrificed his life to set up everything.

218
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:04,370
He wouldn't have done this

219
00:13:05,870 --> 00:13:06,730
if there was a better plan.

220
00:13:08,080 --> 00:13:08,700
Perhaps

221
00:13:10,510 --> 00:13:12,220
we can just disband the Mystic Nine?

222
00:13:12,790 --> 00:13:14,460
In Changsha and its neighboring provinces,

223
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:16,420
there are more than 100,000 people

224
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:17,300
under the Mystic Nine.

225
00:13:18,030 --> 00:13:18,770
How can we disband it?

226
00:13:23,360 --> 00:13:23,770
Master Zhang.

227
00:13:25,910 --> 00:13:27,730
Do you have a plan?

228
00:13:32,030 --> 00:13:34,220
Threaten Luo Ang to spare the Mystic Nine.

229
00:13:35,870 --> 00:13:37,220
After the Mystic Nine leave Changsha,

230
00:13:37,480 --> 00:13:38,460
I'll convince Luo Ang

231
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:40,370
not to drag all of you into this.

232
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:43,060
Then, I'll head to Nanjing

233
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:44,770
to receive my punishment.

234
00:13:45,790 --> 00:13:46,970
That means you'll be going against

235
00:13:46,970 --> 00:13:48,420
the Ministry of War.

236
00:13:49,440 --> 00:13:51,130
You will be suspended, or even executed.

237
00:13:52,150 --> 00:13:53,370
Ninth Master will die in vain.

238
00:13:53,870 --> 00:13:54,370
That's good.

239
00:13:55,840 --> 00:13:56,940
I can see him

240
00:13:57,390 --> 00:13:58,250
and apologize to him.

241
00:13:58,910 --> 00:13:59,420
Master Zhang.

242
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:03,530
I can do all this for you.

243
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:05,940
Then, you'll just say

244
00:14:06,910 --> 00:14:08,010
I've gone rogue

245
00:14:08,270 --> 00:14:09,220
and have me executed.

246
00:14:10,150 --> 00:14:11,250
To put everything to an end,

247
00:14:13,200 --> 00:14:14,220
I have to die.

248
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:15,730
My death

249
00:14:17,080 --> 00:14:18,340
will convince the Ministry of War

250
00:14:18,910 --> 00:14:20,370
that the Mystic Nine will not rise again.

251
00:14:20,910 --> 00:14:21,650
I won't let this happen.

252
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,130
Remember

253
00:14:58,000 --> 00:14:59,100
when we first met?

254
00:15:00,270 --> 00:15:00,940
I asked

255
00:15:01,750 --> 00:15:04,340
what you would do when all hope seemed lost.

256
00:15:10,700 --> 00:15:13,660
[Ancient Zhang's Residence, Northeastern China]

257
00:15:23,030 --> 00:15:24,460
Traitors

258
00:15:25,510 --> 00:15:26,730
don't deserve a face.

259
00:15:26,730 --> 00:15:27,780
[Traitor]

260
00:15:48,360 --> 00:15:49,340
Outsider.

261
00:15:50,670 --> 00:15:52,180
I have spared you.

262
00:15:53,000 --> 00:15:54,460
You shouldn't be here.

263
00:16:02,790 --> 00:16:03,580
Do you want to live?

264
00:16:06,790 --> 00:16:07,820
You can try

265
00:16:09,030 --> 00:16:10,180
escaping once more.

266
00:16:21,790 --> 00:16:22,610
Do you want to live?

267
00:16:24,670 --> 00:16:25,770
If you want to live,

268
00:16:28,600 --> 00:16:30,060
I'll save you.

269
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:41,300
Do you want to live or not?

270
00:16:46,120 --> 00:16:47,340
I want to live.

271
00:16:50,030 --> 00:16:51,130
I'll come with you.

272
00:16:57,080 --> 00:16:58,060
Will they catch up to us?

273
00:16:58,600 --> 00:16:59,610
If they do,

274
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:00,770
we're done for.

275
00:17:01,670 --> 00:17:02,300
Don't worry.

276
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:04,810
The Zhang Clan is a mess now.

277
00:17:05,350 --> 00:17:06,900
Their internal issues will keep them occupied.

278
00:17:07,310 --> 00:17:07,980
They don't have time

279
00:17:08,070 --> 00:17:09,140
for outsiders like us.

280
00:17:12,680 --> 00:17:13,770
Why did you save me?

281
00:17:14,640 --> 00:17:16,420
You are from the Zhang Clan's principal family.

282
00:17:17,110 --> 00:17:17,700
Why

283
00:17:18,750 --> 00:17:19,900
did you run away?

284
00:17:22,310 --> 00:17:22,730
Because...

285
00:17:26,480 --> 00:17:27,570
Because I couldn't stand my clan

286
00:17:27,590 --> 00:17:28,420
anymore.

287
00:17:29,590 --> 00:17:30,730
I wanted freedom.

288
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:38,490
That's why I saved you.

289
00:17:39,220 --> 00:17:43,500
♪The prophecy once foretold♪

290
00:17:43,750 --> 00:17:44,770
Thank you for saving me.

291
00:17:45,200 --> 00:17:45,700
Get up.

292
00:17:47,180 --> 00:17:50,820
♪Ask those who've joined♪

293
00:17:52,400 --> 00:17:53,420
If you trust me,

294
00:17:54,720 --> 00:17:55,730
you can follow me.

295
00:17:56,720 --> 00:17:57,140
Perhaps

296
00:17:58,110 --> 00:17:59,730
we'll find a new path for us.

297
00:17:59,960 --> 00:18:00,660
I'll come with you.

298
00:18:01,860 --> 00:18:04,540
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

299
00:18:05,200 --> 00:18:06,050
What is your name?

300
00:18:08,030 --> 00:18:08,490
I'm...

301
00:18:10,680 --> 00:18:11,220
Xiaoyu.

302
00:18:12,960 --> 00:18:14,180
You'll be Xiaoyu from now on.

303
00:18:16,110 --> 00:18:17,090
Zhang Xiaoyu.

304
00:18:17,920 --> 00:18:18,730
A fish is free.

305
00:18:19,830 --> 00:18:20,700
You are free.

306
00:18:23,750 --> 00:18:24,250
Master Zhang.

307
00:18:26,340 --> 00:18:27,010
I am a traitor

308
00:18:27,030 --> 00:18:28,710
expelled by my clan.

309
00:18:31,590 --> 00:18:32,730
Why did you save me?

310
00:18:37,200 --> 00:18:38,530
Because you said you wanted to live.

311
00:18:40,110 --> 00:18:40,900
I'm not one

312
00:18:42,310 --> 00:18:43,220
to look at one's past.

313
00:18:45,110 --> 00:18:45,940
I only see the future.

314
00:18:46,220 --> 00:18:49,980
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

315
00:18:49,980 --> 00:18:52,540
♪Take care♪

316
00:18:52,550 --> 00:18:53,530
Take good care of others.

317
00:18:57,590 --> 00:18:58,010
Master Zhang.

318
00:19:12,140 --> 00:19:15,860
♪The past fades like smoke♪

319
00:19:16,700 --> 00:19:18,420
♪A choice is made in silence♪

320
00:19:19,460 --> 00:19:22,140
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

321
00:19:23,140 --> 00:19:26,620
♪Who is lucky enough to reach the shore?♪

322
00:19:26,900 --> 00:19:29,580
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

323
00:19:29,590 --> 00:19:30,050
Master Zhang.

324
00:19:32,640 --> 00:19:33,290
Forgive me.

325
00:19:34,220 --> 00:19:35,460
♪But this could♪

326
00:19:36,200 --> 00:19:37,660
I am a traitor through and through.

327
00:19:40,900 --> 00:19:41,580
[To Zhang Xiaoyu]

328
00:19:41,580 --> 00:19:44,860
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

329
00:19:45,300 --> 00:19:48,700
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

330
00:19:49,640 --> 00:19:51,290
Dear Adjutant Xiaoyu,

331
00:19:52,070 --> 00:19:53,220
the survival of the Mystic Nine

332
00:19:53,310 --> 00:19:54,700
is upon us.

333
00:19:55,350 --> 00:19:57,140
I have a way to keep the Mystic Nine alive.

334
00:19:57,590 --> 00:19:58,700
We kill six clans to save three clans.

335
00:19:59,510 --> 00:20:01,250
But Master Zhang will not comply.

336
00:20:01,920 --> 00:20:03,490
And he will die for it.

337
00:20:04,590 --> 00:20:06,010
If you want to save Master Zhang,

338
00:20:06,640 --> 00:20:08,220
you need to do three things for me.

339
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:09,530
One,

340
00:20:10,400 --> 00:20:12,570
immobilize Master Zhang for at least one day.

341
00:20:13,310 --> 00:20:15,860
Two, you must kill Huo Wenhai.

342
00:20:16,640 --> 00:20:18,050
Huo Wenhai has a private army.

343
00:20:18,550 --> 00:20:19,770
Something's afoot.

344
00:20:20,110 --> 00:20:22,090
If you don't kill him, he will change everything.

345
00:20:22,640 --> 00:20:24,980
Three, do not break into the prison

346
00:20:25,030 --> 00:20:25,940
to save the Mystic Nine.

347
00:20:26,440 --> 00:20:27,860
I have another plan for that.

348
00:20:28,260 --> 00:20:30,020
♪We too were young once♪

349
00:20:30,020 --> 00:20:31,940
♪Fortunate to brave♪

350
00:20:31,940 --> 00:20:33,860
♪The raging waves together♪

351
00:20:33,860 --> 00:20:36,060
♪Keep the ember lit♪

352
00:20:36,060 --> 00:20:40,460
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

353
00:20:40,660 --> 00:20:43,980
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

354
00:20:44,340 --> 00:20:47,740
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

355
00:20:48,060 --> 00:20:51,780
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

356
00:20:51,980 --> 00:20:55,220
♪Who believes in fate?♪

357
00:20:55,420 --> 00:20:58,700
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

358
00:20:59,180 --> 00:21:02,620
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

359
00:21:02,860 --> 00:21:06,620
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

360
00:21:06,620 --> 00:21:11,340
♪Please♪

361
00:21:12,500 --> 00:21:17,060
♪Do take care of yourself♪

362
00:21:25,240 --> 00:21:25,620
Sir.

363
00:21:26,960 --> 00:21:28,330
Have we found Wu Laogou and the rest?

364
00:21:29,310 --> 00:21:30,330
No updates so far.

365
00:21:31,440 --> 00:21:32,050
But Sir,

366
00:21:32,480 --> 00:21:33,900
Zhang Xiaoyu is here. He wishes to see you.

367
00:21:35,000 --> 00:21:36,420
He drugged Zhang Qishan

368
00:21:36,720 --> 00:21:38,980
and wants to negotiate with you.

369
00:21:41,680 --> 00:21:42,570
Zhang Xiaoyu?

370
00:21:45,510 --> 00:21:46,460
Zhang Qishan

371
00:21:46,590 --> 00:21:48,050
is getting impatient.

372
00:21:48,680 --> 00:21:49,960
He's using such a cheap

373
00:21:49,960 --> 00:21:50,770
trick.

374
00:21:51,640 --> 00:21:52,660
Does he want to kill me that badly?

375
00:21:56,200 --> 00:21:57,490
Zhang Xiaoyu is betraying him?

376
00:21:58,590 --> 00:21:59,570
Does he even believe it himself?

377
00:22:00,110 --> 00:22:01,380
I shall turn him down then.

378
00:22:01,830 --> 00:22:02,220
No.

379
00:22:04,790 --> 00:22:05,420
Let him in.

380
00:22:06,550 --> 00:22:07,250
I want to see

381
00:22:08,070 --> 00:22:09,700
what trick he has.

382
00:22:11,240 --> 00:22:12,530
Bring the men from Xiangxi too.

383
00:22:13,200 --> 00:22:14,660
I'll make sure he won't get out alive.

384
00:22:14,760 --> 00:22:15,250
Yes.

385
00:22:20,180 --> 00:22:21,660
[Changsha Defense Headquarters]

386
00:22:27,110 --> 00:22:28,290
You even brought

387
00:22:28,350 --> 00:22:29,980
Zhang Qishan's military seal.

388
00:22:30,310 --> 00:22:31,220
You sure

389
00:22:31,240 --> 00:22:32,180
have gone out of your way.

390
00:22:33,160 --> 00:22:34,010
I stole it.

391
00:22:34,590 --> 00:22:36,380
How loyal of you.

392
00:22:37,270 --> 00:22:38,380
Commander Huo,

393
00:22:38,790 --> 00:22:40,050
can we talk now?

394
00:22:40,720 --> 00:22:41,770
After all, it concerns

395
00:22:42,110 --> 00:22:43,900
your life.

396
00:22:45,550 --> 00:22:46,380
Tell me.

397
00:22:47,680 --> 00:22:49,460
You'd better be telling the truth.

398
00:22:50,030 --> 00:22:50,980
Do you know

399
00:22:51,960 --> 00:22:53,250
what Officer Luo and Master Zhang

400
00:22:54,200 --> 00:22:55,770
talked about?

401
00:22:59,000 --> 00:22:59,570
Tell me.

402
00:22:59,720 --> 00:23:01,050
He didn't return to Changsha

403
00:23:02,000 --> 00:23:03,180
for official business.

404
00:23:04,000 --> 00:23:05,180
He came back to rescue someone.

405
00:23:05,960 --> 00:23:07,530
He did it to rescue Master Zhang

406
00:23:08,000 --> 00:23:09,860
so that Master Zhang can continue working for the Ministry of War.

407
00:23:10,480 --> 00:23:12,860
He wants Master Zhang to eliminate the Mystic Nine

408
00:23:13,350 --> 00:23:15,180
personally as proof of allegiance.

409
00:23:15,590 --> 00:23:16,290
That way,

410
00:23:17,550 --> 00:23:19,050
the Ministry of War no longer has a thorn in their side.

411
00:23:20,110 --> 00:23:20,860
But it's at the cost

412
00:23:23,790 --> 00:23:24,460
of your life.

413
00:23:29,000 --> 00:23:30,330
Xie Jiu committed suicide by drinking poison.

414
00:23:31,550 --> 00:23:32,810
Before he died, he left a letter

415
00:23:33,640 --> 00:23:37,220
saying that he and you worked for the Japanese.

416
00:23:38,350 --> 00:23:39,730
After you surrender your position,

417
00:23:40,550 --> 00:23:42,180
Master Zhang can take over

418
00:23:42,400 --> 00:23:44,220
as the new special commissioner, replacing you.

419
00:23:45,160 --> 00:23:46,980
He'll have the power to eliminate the Mystic Nine.

420
00:23:53,830 --> 00:23:55,090
You're trying to drive a wedge between us.

421
00:23:56,550 --> 00:23:57,330
Do you think

422
00:23:57,350 --> 00:23:58,180
I'll take your word

423
00:23:58,200 --> 00:23:59,290
at face value?

424
00:23:59,790 --> 00:24:00,730
You know very well

425
00:24:02,000 --> 00:24:03,090
if I'm telling the truth or not.

426
00:24:04,400 --> 00:24:05,660
If what you're saying is true,

427
00:24:06,590 --> 00:24:07,380
isn't that

428
00:24:07,400 --> 00:24:08,420
what you want as well?

429
00:24:09,160 --> 00:24:10,250
Why did you

430
00:24:10,310 --> 00:24:11,180
come here today?

431
00:24:11,830 --> 00:24:12,730
People like us

432
00:24:14,030 --> 00:24:14,940
followed him back then

433
00:24:15,960 --> 00:24:17,660
and fought our way out of Northeastern China.

434
00:24:18,550 --> 00:24:19,700
Every time, we put our necks

435
00:24:19,750 --> 00:24:21,420
on the line for him.

436
00:24:22,400 --> 00:24:23,090
In the end,

437
00:24:24,030 --> 00:24:25,180
he decides to sacrifice

438
00:24:25,830 --> 00:24:26,380
all of us

439
00:24:26,400 --> 00:24:27,530
to save the Mystic Nine.

440
00:24:29,680 --> 00:24:30,700
Then shouldn't you

441
00:24:30,720 --> 00:24:31,900
kill Zhang Qishan right away?

442
00:24:32,160 --> 00:24:33,330
Master Zhang saved me.

443
00:24:33,440 --> 00:24:34,700
I will not harm him.

444
00:24:35,720 --> 00:24:37,140
But Wu Laogou,

445
00:24:37,510 --> 00:24:38,900
Huo Xiangu, and Qi Tiezui

446
00:24:39,000 --> 00:24:40,050
are all missing.

447
00:24:40,880 --> 00:24:42,050
I know where they are.

448
00:24:56,960 --> 00:24:57,940
Before Master Zhang returned,

449
00:24:58,070 --> 00:24:59,180
he gave them a place to stay.

450
00:25:00,750 --> 00:25:01,570
Right now,

451
00:25:03,310 --> 00:25:04,700
they are in an old military site

452
00:25:04,790 --> 00:25:05,810
at the northwestern part of the city.

453
00:25:26,540 --> 00:25:28,260
[Traitor]

454
00:27:47,920 --> 00:27:48,530
Master Zhang.

455
00:27:50,200 --> 00:27:51,700
I will never

456
00:27:53,200 --> 00:27:54,180
betray you again.

457
00:28:05,180 --> 00:28:13,220
[Xuanzhen Temple]

458
00:28:18,660 --> 00:28:20,460
[Xuanzhen Temple]

459
00:28:23,140 --> 00:28:25,900
[Xuanzhen Temple]

460
00:28:37,720 --> 00:28:38,220
Sir,

461
00:28:39,270 --> 00:28:40,530
is there a letter for me

462
00:28:41,000 --> 00:28:41,810
here?

463
00:28:54,160 --> 00:28:57,010
The man who left this letter

464
00:28:57,270 --> 00:28:58,330
said you were illiterate.

465
00:28:58,680 --> 00:29:01,490
So I shall read it to you.

466
00:29:02,240 --> 00:29:02,730
Thank you.

467
00:29:06,880 --> 00:29:09,460
Fifth Master, I hope this letter finds you well.

468
00:29:10,270 --> 00:29:13,050
When you're reading this,

469
00:29:13,750 --> 00:29:17,330
I'm probably already dead.

470
00:29:18,640 --> 00:29:23,140
The Mystic Nine is destined to fall.

471
00:29:36,720 --> 00:29:37,330
Ninth Master.

472
00:29:38,590 --> 00:29:39,420
Laogou.

473
00:29:41,110 --> 00:29:42,770
It is inescapable that the Ministry of War

474
00:29:43,880 --> 00:29:45,090
will eliminate the Mystic Nine.

475
00:29:47,480 --> 00:29:48,450
Master Zhang

476
00:29:48,450 --> 00:29:49,730
will use his life

477
00:29:50,000 --> 00:29:51,620
to threaten the Ministry of War

478
00:29:53,030 --> 00:29:55,530
to spare us.

479
00:29:56,590 --> 00:29:57,050
But that

480
00:29:59,160 --> 00:30:01,380
is merely prolonging the inevitable.

481
00:30:05,070 --> 00:30:06,570
The Mystic Nine will not let Master Zhang die.

482
00:30:07,480 --> 00:30:08,620
The war needs him.

483
00:30:10,440 --> 00:30:11,330
Therefore,

484
00:30:12,400 --> 00:30:13,940
when they execute Master Zhang,

485
00:30:15,160 --> 00:30:16,180
to save him,

486
00:30:17,110 --> 00:30:18,290
the Mystic Nine will return

487
00:30:18,880 --> 00:30:20,660
to break him out.

488
00:30:22,030 --> 00:30:22,770
When that happens,

489
00:30:24,830 --> 00:30:26,770
all of us will die.

490
00:30:30,030 --> 00:30:31,460
Look no further than the story of Water Margin

491
00:30:33,240 --> 00:30:35,250
to know what happened to those who tried to break the prisoner out.

492
00:30:35,830 --> 00:30:36,460
We

493
00:30:38,070 --> 00:30:40,050
should be the heroes in the story.

494
00:30:40,790 --> 00:30:41,380
Tell me.

495
00:30:42,510 --> 00:30:43,490
What is your plan?

496
00:30:45,400 --> 00:30:47,420
You hold the key

497
00:30:50,790 --> 00:30:52,330
to our plan.

498
00:30:54,590 --> 00:30:55,460
You're overestimating me.

499
00:30:56,510 --> 00:30:57,460
I raise dogs. That's all.

500
00:30:58,110 --> 00:30:58,900
Fifth Master,

501
00:31:00,880 --> 00:31:02,900
you're so much better than you think.

502
00:31:04,240 --> 00:31:07,770
Everyone worships Master Zhang like a deity.

503
00:31:08,680 --> 00:31:10,460
But a deity is not a mortal.

504
00:31:11,680 --> 00:31:13,530
He doesn't know how to love like a mortal does.

505
00:31:14,510 --> 00:31:15,940
But Fifth Master, you are a mortal.

506
00:31:16,960 --> 00:31:18,050
That's why

507
00:31:19,880 --> 00:31:21,620
only you can save the people.

508
00:31:21,960 --> 00:31:23,620
Only you can save the deity.

509
00:31:24,070 --> 00:31:24,770
I can't.

510
00:31:26,350 --> 00:31:27,490
I kill the deity.

511
00:31:29,030 --> 00:31:29,570
Exactly.

512
00:31:31,550 --> 00:31:32,660
That is precisely the reason.

513
00:31:33,880 --> 00:31:35,140
Among the Mystic Nine,

514
00:31:36,790 --> 00:31:38,810
you're the one who despises our ways the most,

515
00:31:39,440 --> 00:31:41,420
the one who can't stand the Mystic Nine.

516
00:31:43,270 --> 00:31:45,380
Everyone in Changsha City knows that.

517
00:31:47,830 --> 00:31:48,860
Therefore,

518
00:31:49,880 --> 00:31:51,010
you have to become

519
00:31:51,070 --> 00:31:53,250
the head of the Mystic Nine.

520
00:31:53,830 --> 00:31:55,700
That way, the Ministry of War

521
00:31:56,680 --> 00:31:57,330
will think

522
00:31:58,350 --> 00:32:00,420
that when they kill you,

523
00:32:01,270 --> 00:32:02,530
the other clans

524
00:32:03,510 --> 00:32:05,460
will not return to save you.

525
00:32:07,200 --> 00:32:08,980
Then, most people in the Mystic Nine

526
00:32:11,920 --> 00:32:13,730
will be safe.

527
00:32:16,270 --> 00:32:17,730
Only you

528
00:32:19,550 --> 00:32:21,810
can save us from this predicament.

529
00:32:23,110 --> 00:32:24,250
You want me to sacrifice myself

530
00:32:25,070 --> 00:32:26,140
for the Mystic Nine?

531
00:32:28,830 --> 00:32:29,770
Why should I do that?

532
00:32:35,680 --> 00:32:37,050
If you do not help us,

533
00:32:37,960 --> 00:32:40,050
the Mystic Nine will lose the protection afforded by Master Zhang.

534
00:32:40,640 --> 00:32:42,290
Thousands of our members

535
00:32:42,640 --> 00:32:44,330
will be executed by the Ministry of War.

536
00:32:45,000 --> 00:32:47,180
The women and the vulnerable will be expelled from Changsha,

537
00:32:47,350 --> 00:32:48,570
left to their own devices.

538
00:32:49,440 --> 00:32:50,090
I believe

539
00:32:51,440 --> 00:32:52,900
you don't want

540
00:32:53,640 --> 00:32:55,380
to see that happen.

541
00:32:57,070 --> 00:32:58,180
You're threatening me now.

542
00:32:58,720 --> 00:33:00,090
It's the reality.

543
00:33:01,640 --> 00:33:02,380
Of course,

544
00:33:04,510 --> 00:33:06,290
you can choose to ignore all this.

545
00:33:18,110 --> 00:33:19,010
Even if I agree to this,

546
00:33:19,640 --> 00:33:20,730
according to the rules in the Mystic Nine,

547
00:33:21,470 --> 00:33:22,950
I have to kill the previous master

548
00:33:23,310 --> 00:33:24,330
to take over their position.

549
00:33:24,550 --> 00:33:25,530
Do you want me to kill every master

550
00:33:25,550 --> 00:33:26,250
in the Mystic Nine?

551
00:33:26,750 --> 00:33:27,570
No need to kill.

552
00:33:29,070 --> 00:33:30,090
Just render them useless.

553
00:33:31,590 --> 00:33:32,420
But

554
00:33:33,200 --> 00:33:34,980
the Ministry of War has already infiltrated the Mystic Nine.

555
00:33:35,920 --> 00:33:37,010
Each clan

556
00:33:37,310 --> 00:33:39,570
has spies from the Ministry of War.

557
00:33:40,640 --> 00:33:41,330
Hence,

558
00:33:43,160 --> 00:33:45,220
you must hit where it hurts the most

559
00:33:45,790 --> 00:33:47,420
so that the Ministry of War will believe

560
00:33:47,920 --> 00:33:49,330
that they no longer

561
00:33:49,400 --> 00:33:50,700
pose a threat.

562
00:33:53,000 --> 00:33:54,010
Like how?

563
00:33:57,000 --> 00:33:57,700
For example,

564
00:33:59,110 --> 00:34:01,010
turn Eryue Hong into a cripple

565
00:34:03,830 --> 00:34:04,810
so that

566
00:34:04,880 --> 00:34:06,180
he can no longer perform.

567
00:34:06,240 --> 00:34:07,290
Xie Jiu, you're insane!

568
00:34:07,790 --> 00:34:09,210
That's no different from killing him.

569
00:34:09,510 --> 00:34:11,010
The Ministry of War won't believe you

570
00:34:11,070 --> 00:34:12,900
unless you go that far.

571
00:34:13,880 --> 00:34:14,610
When that happens,

572
00:34:15,920 --> 00:34:18,300
no one in the Mystic Nine can live.

573
00:34:19,760 --> 00:34:20,530
Fifth Master.

574
00:34:22,400 --> 00:34:24,530
Sacrifice a few lives

575
00:34:25,710 --> 00:34:26,570
or

576
00:34:26,630 --> 00:34:28,820
the thousands of lives in the Mystic Nine?

577
00:34:31,070 --> 00:34:31,940
The masters of Mystic Nine

578
00:34:33,400 --> 00:34:34,530
saved my life

579
00:34:35,880 --> 00:34:37,010
in Xinyue Restaurant.

580
00:34:40,230 --> 00:34:41,300
Is this how I repay

581
00:34:42,190 --> 00:34:43,380
their kindness?

582
00:34:44,880 --> 00:34:48,210
Saving our lives is simple.

583
00:34:49,230 --> 00:34:50,460
I have plenty of ways.

584
00:34:51,070 --> 00:34:51,980
What's difficult

585
00:34:54,280 --> 00:34:57,010
is saving thousands of lives.

586
00:34:58,030 --> 00:34:59,900
Save a thousand lives

587
00:35:00,070 --> 00:35:01,530
or save nine lives.

588
00:35:01,880 --> 00:35:03,570
You decide.

589
00:35:10,480 --> 00:35:11,260
You know

590
00:35:11,320 --> 00:35:12,260
what kind of person I am.

591
00:35:14,320 --> 00:35:15,460
That's why you're asking for my help.

592
00:35:31,920 --> 00:35:33,820
The Mystic Nine is on its last breath.

593
00:35:34,760 --> 00:35:36,260
It is an emergency.

594
00:35:37,280 --> 00:35:38,860
Hesitation will lead to irreversible changes.

595
00:35:41,590 --> 00:35:42,210
Fifth Master.

596
00:35:43,360 --> 00:35:44,090
I

597
00:35:45,840 --> 00:35:47,780
count on you for the survival of the Mystic Nine.

598
00:36:01,800 --> 00:36:02,740
That's so unfair.

599
00:36:05,480 --> 00:36:06,490
That's so unfair.

600
00:36:08,400 --> 00:36:10,300
Did God let me join the Mystic Nine

601
00:36:12,840 --> 00:36:13,610
so that

602
00:36:13,710 --> 00:36:15,170
I can die for them instead?

603
00:36:35,030 --> 00:36:35,460
Sir.

604
00:36:35,880 --> 00:36:37,260
There's an uproar.

605
00:36:37,800 --> 00:36:39,270
All news outlets are reporting

606
00:36:39,270 --> 00:36:41,010
about Changsha's curfew and their manhunt for cultists.

607
00:36:42,230 --> 00:36:43,570
But the evidence shows

608
00:36:43,800 --> 00:36:45,900
that there is no cultist at all.

609
00:36:46,440 --> 00:36:48,130
[Curfew]
They say the Ministry of War

610
00:36:48,230 --> 00:36:49,130
framed the righteous people.

611
00:36:49,550 --> 00:36:50,690
The rumor is spreading like wildfire.

612
00:36:51,920 --> 00:36:53,490
The city was locked down for two days

613
00:36:54,550 --> 00:36:55,550
and the news has traveled

614
00:36:55,550 --> 00:36:56,530
to Nanjing and Shanghai.

615
00:37:02,670 --> 00:37:05,780
Someone is expediting the process.

616
00:37:07,400 --> 00:37:07,940
Sir,

617
00:37:08,440 --> 00:37:09,090
if this carries on,

618
00:37:09,360 --> 00:37:10,300
the higher-up will do more

619
00:37:10,320 --> 00:37:11,170
than just questioning us.

620
00:37:11,710 --> 00:37:12,820
We must lift the curfew

621
00:37:13,150 --> 00:37:14,260
and release the masters

622
00:37:14,320 --> 00:37:15,170
of Mystic Nine.

623
00:37:17,800 --> 00:37:18,260
Sure.

624
00:37:19,400 --> 00:37:20,820
It's time to let them go.

625
00:37:21,360 --> 00:37:21,650
Yes.

626
00:37:30,260 --> 00:37:32,340
[Notice]

627
00:37:44,110 --> 00:37:45,050
No more curfew in Changsha.

628
00:37:48,550 --> 00:37:49,460
The masters of Mystic Nine

629
00:37:49,760 --> 00:37:50,780
have been released.

630
00:37:50,820 --> 00:37:51,510
[It is done.]

631
00:37:51,510 --> 00:37:52,570
[Your trouble is gone for now.]
We can finally go back.

632
00:37:52,570 --> 00:37:53,260
[Take care.]

633
00:37:54,960 --> 00:37:55,610
Great.

634
00:37:57,630 --> 00:37:58,260
Where's Wu Laogou?

635
00:37:58,800 --> 00:37:59,340
Laogou is...

636
00:38:01,710 --> 00:38:02,340
Laogou!

637
00:38:04,260 --> 00:38:23,020
[Pear Garden]

638
00:38:25,380 --> 00:38:26,860
[Closed]

639
00:38:29,180 --> 00:38:31,420
[Pear Garden]

640
00:38:38,500 --> 00:38:49,540
[Pear Garden]

641
00:39:32,150 --> 00:39:32,690
Laogou.

642
00:39:33,710 --> 00:39:34,780
Didn't you leave Changsha

643
00:39:35,030 --> 00:39:36,530
with Master Zhang already?

644
00:39:38,150 --> 00:39:38,650
Where is Master Zhang?

645
00:40:00,710 --> 00:40:02,490
The Ministry of War wants the Mystic Nine gone.

646
00:40:03,400 --> 00:40:04,380
They spared us this time,

647
00:40:04,800 --> 00:40:05,650
but it won't last long.

648
00:40:06,670 --> 00:40:07,420
Next time,

649
00:40:09,400 --> 00:40:10,610
they'll kill us.

650
00:40:14,320 --> 00:40:14,780
Laogou.

651
00:40:15,590 --> 00:40:16,300
Leave Changsha

652
00:40:17,630 --> 00:40:18,900
when you still have the chance.

653
00:40:21,000 --> 00:40:22,460
I will take my wife with me

654
00:40:24,070 --> 00:40:25,260
to the west.

655
00:41:07,280 --> 00:41:07,780
What about you?

656
00:41:09,480 --> 00:41:10,210
What's your plan?

657
00:41:11,800 --> 00:41:12,420
I

658
00:41:15,070 --> 00:41:16,170
joined the Mystic Nine.

659
00:41:17,760 --> 00:41:19,610
I finally became one of the top brass.

660
00:41:20,880 --> 00:41:21,940
I'm not going to leave.

661
00:41:28,590 --> 00:41:29,170
Second Master,

662
00:41:29,920 --> 00:41:31,170
I haven't thanked you properly yet.

663
00:41:32,590 --> 00:41:34,010
When I first joined the Mystic Nine,

664
00:41:35,070 --> 00:41:36,170
I thought you'd look down on a dog breeder

665
00:41:36,230 --> 00:41:37,010
like me.

666
00:41:37,920 --> 00:41:39,570
To my surprise, you brought me business,

667
00:41:40,110 --> 00:41:41,820
thus allowing me to find my footing in Changsha.

668
00:41:44,230 --> 00:41:45,300
I'll always remember

669
00:41:46,670 --> 00:41:47,690
this favor from you.

670
00:41:49,840 --> 00:41:50,460
A toast

671
00:41:52,110 --> 00:41:52,860
to you.

672
00:41:56,670 --> 00:41:57,690
It's all in the past.

673
00:42:13,710 --> 00:42:16,340
But I need to mention something from the past.

674
00:42:17,150 --> 00:42:17,690
After all,

675
00:42:19,110 --> 00:42:20,420
I joined the Mystic Nine

676
00:42:21,710 --> 00:42:22,780
because of you.

677
00:42:26,320 --> 00:42:27,740
Perhaps you do not know.

678
00:42:30,000 --> 00:42:30,740
Back then,

679
00:42:31,440 --> 00:42:33,050
I was down there, below the stage.

680
00:42:35,710 --> 00:42:37,010
I watched your troupe

681
00:42:37,670 --> 00:42:38,530
perform

682
00:42:39,920 --> 00:42:41,530
a popular opera

683
00:42:41,760 --> 00:42:44,210
called Havoc in Heaven.

684
00:42:48,070 --> 00:42:48,420
Moreover,

685
00:42:49,630 --> 00:42:50,780
in Xiangyuan Mine,

686
00:42:51,400 --> 00:42:53,170
many laborers were exploited.

687
00:42:54,070 --> 00:42:56,390
I begged the masters of the Mystic Nine

688
00:42:56,390 --> 00:42:57,980
to save the people.

689
00:42:58,670 --> 00:42:59,530
I even

690
00:42:59,550 --> 00:43:01,460
visited your residence.

691
00:43:02,190 --> 00:43:03,010
Do you know

692
00:43:03,070 --> 00:43:04,130
what your man said?

693
00:43:10,510 --> 00:43:12,260
The Second Master of the Mystic Nine

694
00:43:12,670 --> 00:43:15,130
is not someone a nobody could see.

695
00:43:21,510 --> 00:43:21,940
Yes.

696
00:43:24,590 --> 00:43:26,210
I was a nobody back then.

697
00:43:27,590 --> 00:43:28,860
I didn't have the right

698
00:43:28,880 --> 00:43:29,420
to see you.

699
00:43:29,960 --> 00:43:30,650
Who was I

700
00:43:30,880 --> 00:43:32,690
to defend the common folks?

701
00:43:36,030 --> 00:43:37,260
I wasn't aware

702
00:43:38,710 --> 00:43:39,780
of this.

703
00:43:43,440 --> 00:43:44,010
When did that happen?

704
00:43:47,070 --> 00:43:48,010
It

705
00:43:48,070 --> 00:43:49,380
will never reach your ears anyway.

706
00:43:51,710 --> 00:43:52,940
This door of yours

707
00:43:53,920 --> 00:43:54,820
separates two worlds.

708
00:43:55,920 --> 00:43:57,490
How much mortal suffering will you see

709
00:43:58,320 --> 00:44:00,170
sitting behind this door?

710
00:44:02,920 --> 00:44:03,380
So

711
00:44:05,400 --> 00:44:06,780
I understand why the Monkey King

712
00:44:06,780 --> 00:44:08,260
wreaked havoc in heaven.

713
00:44:09,590 --> 00:44:10,740
I also understand that only by

714
00:44:11,510 --> 00:44:13,570
joining the top brass

715
00:44:14,320 --> 00:44:16,690
can I achieve what an ordinary person cannot.

716
00:44:27,800 --> 00:44:28,530
Laogou.

717
00:44:31,760 --> 00:44:32,530
What

718
00:44:34,280 --> 00:44:35,090
are you getting at?

719
00:44:35,400 --> 00:44:36,650
Listen.

720
00:44:37,630 --> 00:44:39,050
After I joined the Mystic Nine,

721
00:44:41,880 --> 00:44:44,010
I found out that top brass like you

722
00:44:44,480 --> 00:44:45,780
did not put your talent to good use.

723
00:44:46,320 --> 00:44:47,690
You fight among each other,

724
00:44:47,960 --> 00:44:49,460
and do nothing if something bad happens.

725
00:44:49,550 --> 00:44:50,380
Do you care

726
00:44:50,400 --> 00:44:51,490
about the ordinary folks?

727
00:44:51,710 --> 00:44:52,650
Have you thought

728
00:44:52,880 --> 00:44:54,740
about delivering them from their misery?

729
00:44:59,800 --> 00:45:00,460
I don't think so.

730
00:45:03,760 --> 00:45:04,820
None of you ever did.

731
00:45:12,670 --> 00:45:16,380
It begins here, so it shall end here.

732
00:45:17,150 --> 00:45:18,340
I returned here

733
00:45:19,320 --> 00:45:20,980
to wreak havoc in heaven.

734
00:45:22,070 --> 00:45:22,820
I will

735
00:45:22,840 --> 00:45:24,890
eliminate you so-called deities

736
00:45:24,890 --> 00:45:26,300
one by one.

737
00:45:26,440 --> 00:45:27,210
The first one

738
00:45:27,840 --> 00:45:29,980
is you, Eryue Hong.

739
00:45:52,150 --> 00:45:52,820
Don't move.

740
00:45:54,320 --> 00:45:55,570
Or you'll die even quicker.

741
00:46:00,670 --> 00:46:02,300
The poison is still in your body, isn't it?

742
00:46:04,590 --> 00:46:05,570
The liquor is not poisoned.

743
00:46:07,190 --> 00:46:08,050
I merely added

744
00:46:08,110 --> 00:46:09,460
something that boosts your blood circulation

745
00:46:10,920 --> 00:46:12,130
so that it activates

746
00:46:12,440 --> 00:46:13,780
the toxin in your body.

747
00:46:34,480 --> 00:46:35,260
Laogou.

748
00:46:37,630 --> 00:46:38,980
What are you trying to do?

749
00:46:50,880 --> 00:46:51,650
Laogou!

750
00:46:52,800 --> 00:46:53,650
You've gone insane!

751
00:46:53,960 --> 00:46:54,860
Humans

752
00:46:56,110 --> 00:46:57,940
cannot escape love, it seems.

753
00:46:59,480 --> 00:47:01,010
You are the Second Master of the Mystic Nine.

754
00:47:01,920 --> 00:47:03,130
How could you let yourself be imprisoned

755
00:47:03,230 --> 00:47:04,300
by your feelings?

756
00:47:05,960 --> 00:47:07,900
You let yourself turn rusty,

757
00:47:08,960 --> 00:47:10,820
giving the Ministry of War a chance to infiltrate us.

758
00:47:14,280 --> 00:47:15,170
You

759
00:47:16,070 --> 00:47:17,570
brought this upon yourself.

760
00:47:20,480 --> 00:47:21,980
No!

761
00:47:22,440 --> 00:47:25,170
No!

762
00:47:26,190 --> 00:47:28,980
No!

763
00:47:30,760 --> 00:47:31,340
No...

764
00:47:34,000 --> 00:47:35,210
No!

765
00:47:36,110 --> 00:47:39,130
No!

766
00:47:40,110 --> 00:47:40,900
No!

767
00:47:41,280 --> 00:47:42,900
Put it down.

768
00:47:44,280 --> 00:47:45,130
No.

769
00:47:45,510 --> 00:47:48,210
No!

770
00:48:04,940 --> 00:48:09,100
♪The past fades like smoke♪

771
00:48:09,460 --> 00:48:12,180
♪A choice is made in silence♪

772
00:48:12,460 --> 00:48:15,260
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

773
00:48:15,660 --> 00:48:19,420
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

774
00:48:19,660 --> 00:48:23,100
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

775
00:48:23,380 --> 00:48:26,780
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

776
00:48:26,860 --> 00:48:34,140
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

777
00:48:34,580 --> 00:48:37,860
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

778
00:48:38,140 --> 00:48:41,380
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

779
00:48:41,540 --> 00:48:45,580
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

780
00:48:45,780 --> 00:48:49,140
♪Who believes in fate?♪

781
00:48:49,380 --> 00:48:52,740
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

782
00:48:52,980 --> 00:48:56,260
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

783
00:48:56,580 --> 00:49:00,260
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

784
00:49:00,460 --> 00:49:03,700
♪Take care♪

785
00:49:03,700 --> 00:49:06,260
♪We once raced♪

786
00:49:06,340 --> 00:49:08,260
♪For the dawn♪

787
00:49:08,420 --> 00:49:11,700
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

788
00:49:11,820 --> 00:49:15,100
♪In the web of fate♪

789
00:49:15,100 --> 00:49:18,300
♪No one can escape♪

790
00:49:19,300 --> 00:49:21,140
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

791
00:49:21,300 --> 00:49:22,860
♪We too were young once♪

792
00:49:22,940 --> 00:49:26,380
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

793
00:49:26,580 --> 00:49:28,900
♪Keep the ember lit♪

794
00:49:29,020 --> 00:49:33,540
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

795
00:49:33,660 --> 00:49:36,620
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

796
00:49:36,860 --> 00:49:40,380
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

797
00:49:40,500 --> 00:49:44,260
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

798
00:49:44,580 --> 00:49:48,060
♪Who believes in fate?♪

799
00:49:48,220 --> 00:49:51,220
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

800
00:49:51,460 --> 00:49:55,220
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

801
00:49:55,380 --> 00:49:59,100
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

802
00:49:59,220 --> 00:50:10,660
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
